  abilityDesc: 23 combo powerful Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), 4 combo powerful Light attack on single foe, hugely boosts Light types'
    Atk, Def for 3 turns, raises normal hit amount for 3 turns, hugely boosts Light
    elemental damage for 3 turns & negates critical and elemental damage for 2 turns
